  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zhejiang Urban Environment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s objective is to enhance the efficiency and equity of waste management in Ningbo (wastewater) and Hangzhou (solidwaste) municipalities and the redevelopment of the historic inner city of Shaoxing and Cicheng, thereby facilitating the sustainable development of these cities and establishing a model for conservation of cultural heritage in other Chinese cities.</narrative>
  </description>
